['|Case|:**view_entries**\n```\nFUNCTION view_entries()\n    CALL JournalEntry.load_entries()  # Load all entries from storage\n\n    RETURN entries  # Return the list of journal entries to be displayed in the dashboard\nEND FUNCTION\n\nFUNCTION load_entries()\n    IF "entries.txt" does NOT exist THEN\n        RETURN {}  # Return empty if no entries exist\n    ENDIF\n\n    OPEN "entries.txt" for reading AS file\n        SET entries = {}\n        FOR EACH line IN file\n            SPLIT line INTO entry_id and data\n            entries[entry_id] = PARSE JSON(data)  # Convert string data to JSON\n        ENDFOR\n    CLOSE file\n\n    RETURN entries  # Return the parsed entries\nEND FUNCTION\n\n@APP_ROUTE(\'/dashboard\', methods=[\'GET\', \'POST\'])\nFUNCTION dashboard()\n    IF \'username\' NOT IN SESSION THEN\n        REDIRECT to \'login\'  # Redirect if user is not logged in\n    ENDIF\n\n    SET travel_log = NEW TravelLog()  # Create travel log instance\n    IF request.method IS \'POST\' THEN\n        # Handle entry creation logic\n    ENDIF\n\n    SET entries = travel_log.view_entries()  # Retrieve entries\n    RENDER \'dashboard.html\' WITH entries  # Render dashboard template with entries\nEND FUNCTION\n```\n|Case|:**navigate_back_to_dashboard**\n```\n@APP_ROUTE(\'/login\', methods=[\'GET\', \'POST\'])\nFUNCTION login()\n    IF request.method IS \'POST\' THEN\n        GET username FROM request\n        GET password FROM request\n\n        SET user = NEW User(username, password)\n        IF user.login() THEN\n            SET SESSION[\'username\'] = username  # Store username in session\n            REDIRECT to \'dashboard\'  # Redirect to dashboard on successful login\n        ENDIF\n    ENDIF\n\n    RENDER \'login.html\'  # Show login template if GET request\nEND FUNCTION\n\n@APP_ROUTE(\'/register\', methods=[\'GET\', \'POST\'])\nFUNCTION register()\n    IF request.method IS \'POST\' THEN\n        # Handle registration logic\n    ENDIF\n    \n    RENDER \'register.html\'  # Show registration template\nEND FUNCTION\n```']
